// From the law, section 302(3), on a hoist of 1000: fly 1900; star's long points 310 from
// its center, others 222, inner circle 98; each bar 16 wide at the hoist, and 392 at the fly.
// Section 302(1): 24 points 15 degrees apart, the four along the axes the long ones; the
// star equally far from the hoist, the top and the top of the orange bar.
// Not in the law: the blue margins at the hoist's foot and the fly's head. These are 16,
// following a FOTW contributor's assumption that they equal the hoist width of a bar.
// Derived here: the orange's top runs (0, 952) to (1900, 16), so the star's center is
// d = 1900 x 952 / (936 + 1900 + sqrt(936^2 + 1900^2)) = 365.12 from both edges.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Marshall Islands"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20210418142854/http://www.paclii.org/mh/legis/consol_act/ofotmia1979292/"
  source "https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/mh.html"
  note "The bar widths at the fly are the law's: 0.392 of the hoist each. FOTW's contributors think this a doubling, since flags and drawings show about half that, and the Album des Pavillons gives about 0.2 each. This file follows the law's text, so it looks different from flags in use."
  note "The law sets the blue margins at neither end. The 0.016 here is an assumption, not the law."
  note "The law leaves shades to an Executive Order of the Cabinet, which FOTW's contributor couldn't find and which wasn't read. The hex, Pantone and CMYK values are the Album des Pavillons 2023's, as reported by FOTW. The Album itself wasn't read."
  note "The Revised Code's text mentions only the points parallel to the fly as longer. P.L. 1979-1 as FOTW quotes it also names those parallel to the hoist, as drawn here."
  note "FOTW's quotation of P.L. 1979-1 has .16 for the bars at the hoist, where the Revised Code has .016, printed '.0I6'. This follows the Code."
  law "Official Flag of the Marshall Islands Act 1979, 1 MIRC Ch. 3, section 302" {
    source "https://web.archive.org/web/20210418142854/http://www.paclii.org/mh/legis/consol_act/ofotmia1979292/"
  }
}
palette {
  blue "#003598" {
    pantone "287 C"
    cmyk 100 83 7 0
  }
  orange "#e76f00" {
    pantone "152 C"
    cmyk 4 66 100 0
  }
  white "#ffffff"
}
proportion hoist=1000 fly=1900

field blue
charge polygon orange {
  point fly=0 hoist=952
  point fly=0 hoist=968
  point fly=1900 hoist=408
  point fly=1900 hoist=16
}
charge polygon white {
  point fly=0 hoist=968
  point fly=0 hoist=984
  point fly=1900 hoist=800
  point fly=1900 hoist=408
}
charge polygon white {
  point fly=365.12 hoist=55.12
  point fly=377.91 hoist=267.95
  point fly=422.57 hoist=150.68
  point fly=402.62 hoist=274.58
  point fly=476.12 hoist=172.86
